  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fattigdomsstudier-FLACSO</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Poverty Studies FLACSO II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Specific objectives:   To deepen the understanding of the causes of poverty.  To advance in the commitment of different political, public and social actors that struggles against poverty with policies and actions.   To spread the results of the studies and debate them</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The project finances the Poverty Studies section of FLACSO, including grants for master students in the poverty area, tuition, new study material, research in poverty, public events, presentation of various poverty studies/reports etc.</narrative>
  </description>
